{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-09-26T19:25:21.686Z","data":{"text":"Done. All 12 `tests/worktree-run.test.ts` scenarios pass, the budgets/lint pass, and `pnpm verify` (typechecks, UI build, full suite, lint) is green.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Implementation**\n- `src/core/run/task-commit.ts` (new) — `commitVerifiedTask` and `commitArchive`, each taking a `Vcs`, building messages via `formatCommitMessage`/`readCommitTrailers`.\n- `src/watcher/worktree-run.ts` (new) — `checkWorktree` (HEAD on `osq/<folder>`, clean outside the change folder's `.run/` + `tasks.md`) and `haltWorktreeChange` (change-level regression marker + event + log).\n- `src/watcher/worktree-commit.ts` (new) — pending/verified/dead/archive commits with `commit_failed` halts and whole-second outcome lines.\n- `src/watcher/loop.ts` — runs worktree changes instead of skipping them; commits pending done tasks, checks before spawn and archive, commits the passing/dead task, commits the archive; every new call gated on `tree.worktreeFolder` so flag-off is unchanged.\n- `src/watcher/auto-retry.ts` — `vcs_violation` and `scope_violation` added to eligible reasons.\n- `README.md` — Version control, automatic-retry, and dead-reason text updated.\n\n**Tests**\n- `tests/worktree-run.test.ts` (new) covers the worktree run, dirty/off-branch halts and clearing, records-not-dirt, two verified commits and contents, the new outside-scope test file, a left-undone commit, the archive commit, a rejected hook and its retry, the runner and reaper dead paths with patches, and the scope-violation automatic retry.\n- `tests/change-locations-worktrees.test.ts` — dropped only the removed \"Watcher worktree wait\" case.\n\n**Notable deviations documented in the result file**: off-branch is tested via `checkWorktree`/`haltWorktreeChange` directly because `changeTrees` drops off-branch worktrees, pending commits also detect staged `A` done markers (a rejected commit leaves them staged), and pending commits run before the clean check."}}
